[size=5][b]Epoch Assist[/b][/size]

A [url=https://github.com/LavaGang/MelonLoader]MelonLoader[/url] mod suite for Last Epoch. Version {{version}}, tested with Last Epoch {{game_version}}.

[b]Using mods online is against Last Epoch's terms of service.[/b]

[size=4][b]Install[/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install MelonLoader 0.7.x into the game folder and start the game once.
[*]Extract the zip into your Last Epoch folder (where [font=Courier New]Last Epoch.exe[/font] is).
[*]In game, press [b]F2[/b] to open the menu.
[/list]
[size=4][b]Features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Autocast[/b]: [font=Courier New]Left Ctrl[/font] + a skill's key turns autocast on or off for that slot. Optional: enemy gate, aim at the closest enemy, hold-to-pause key.
{{media:autocast}}
[/list][size=4][b]Settings[/b][/size]
Open the Settings tab at the top of the menu. The search box there finds any setting.
[list]
[*][b]Mini HUD[/b]: shows autocast's state and slots while the menu is closed. Click it for quick toggles.
{{media:hud}}
{{media:settings-hud}}
[*][b]Appearance[/b]: themes (Carbonfox, Slate, Ember, Epoch, Glass), fonts and animations.
{{media:appearance}}
[*][b]Keybinds[/b]: change any key.
{{media:keybinds}}
[*][b]Diagnostics[/b]: [b]Copy diagnostics[/b] puts the mod's state on the clipboard for a bug report, without names or folder paths. Nothing is sent anywhere.
{{media:diagnostics}}
[*][b]Profiles[/b]: one setup per character. Export and import to share.
{{media:profiles}}
[/list]

The mod saves everything in [font=Courier New]UserData/EpochAssist/[/font] in the game folder.
